Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Philosopher's Stone \Nwould be in a desolate town like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:13.02,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,It almost seems like a lie that up until just recently, \Nthis town was prosperous from gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:16.65,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Which is why they would be that much more likely to research the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since they stopped being able to get gold out of the mines,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they'd want to transmute it with the Philosopher's Stone that much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This used to be a gold \Nproducing area, and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so if they created just a little, \Nno one would find them out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's terrible the way grown-ups think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use! It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:50.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to help you \Nout of there, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:54.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.50,0:00:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My daughter is pinned!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be patient for a bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.90,0:01:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, to think that an alchemist would come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really came through for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his armored father too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, we're brothers, actually. This is my younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Younger brother? Even though \Nhe's bigger than you, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we're glad that you weren't hurt, Elisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.37,0:04:10.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Elisa all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle Belsio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you \Ncome into my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After making Elisa \Nhelp you out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Elisa. \NNo matter what anyone tells you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can't help Belsio out in his work anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.88,0:04:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Uncle Belsio's fault! \NI asked him to let me help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Elisa! \NHere, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle Belsio told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that your lemon pies \Nwere the best, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that it was a shame that there were so few farms left in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:16.22,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,Hey now, once the Philosopher's Stone is finished, \Nthe town will become prosperous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be able to buy our fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two came to assist \NMugear-sama in his research, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To create a Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Alchemist, please create the Philosopher's Stone as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to get back our town of gold—\NXenotime—no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're depending on you, Master Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's a lot to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in any case, I guess we'll go see this Mugear person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you would please \Ntell us your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Edward. Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-His brother, Alphonse. \NAlphonse Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The State Alchemist ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:08.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hush! The real Elric brothers are already up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back when you've decided to be honest about your real names!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it that's been \Nusing my name here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you really planning to sneak in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch that impostor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and have him tell me about the Philosopher's Stone while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother? Was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A transmutative reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this. This is all material on the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is where they're making \Nthe Philosopher's Stone, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is off-limits to unauthorized persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance, are you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are, you impostors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:41.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which would mean that \Nyou're the real Edward, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.22,0:07:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No! I'm Edward! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the older brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The security guys will \Nrealize you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:08:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know, the real \Nyounger brother wears armor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look like you're fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you want to go at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you guys will go home quietly, I don't plan on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just let us stay here \Nfor a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that any attitude to be asking somebody for something with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop looking down on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would bother you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being only that tall, \Nwhen you're fifteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Automail, huh? The real one \Nhas his troubles too, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By saying that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you sound as if you haven't just been living in idleness yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a look at the skill of a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be sorry you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad. No transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The impostor doesn't use \Na transmutation circle either?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you got a Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that noise just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! I ache all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That impostor sure was strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just the Stone's power, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I wonder if they've completed a Philosopher's Stone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to \Nmake sure we find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what those \Nbrothers' names are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of them must \Nhave real names, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the older brother is older than you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go judging us \Njust on our size!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, let's give this up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If those two report what's really going on, what will we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.48,0:10:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Nobody is going to believe what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and complete the \NPhilosopher's Stone and leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it goes that smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:33.57,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I'm not about to let Mugear get the credit for the research Dad spent his whole life on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it comes to that, I'll make sure that \Nno matter what, at least you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,make me happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you should just be standing there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems some outsiders have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, but not to worry. \NThe Elric brothers have been chased away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys could prove to be extraordinarily crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, having come to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before the military comes to learn of the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that maybe it's about time you pulled out, Mugear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little more time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I will complete the Philosopher's Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:49.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use any means that you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's starting to swell up pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your coldness feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to be of use to you, Brother, even in this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were at the store this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:19.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have no place to stay, come to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't let you children \Nsleep outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:33.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not going to \Nask us our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the Elric brothers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, you believe us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just think that everyone has their own reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who bears responsibility for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't appear to have any interest in the Philosopher's Stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks in this town
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are still unable to forget the wealth that gold has brought them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Mugear has them \Nwrapped around his finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Uncle Belsio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:18.21,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,If you keep coming to my place, \Nyou're going to get yelled at again by your pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa is all wrapped up in talk about the gold mine. He won't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, that looks like it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you get \Nfor telling lies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we're not the ones who are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one \Nwho gets clocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:40.25,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,You don't mean, you're the ones who snuck into Mugear-sama's mansion yesterday, Big Brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it was us! We can't let those impostors get away with this, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, using a Philosopher's Stone to make gold is no small matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go see \Nwhat's happening in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you go to \Nthe drugstore for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to get \NElisa's medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and your brother needs a compress too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, it's that armor. \NHe's that impostor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear! I wish he would hurry up and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll bet it was those boys who broke in \Nto rob Mugear-sama's mansion last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you come here for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I need to get some medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any medicine \Nthat treats liars! Go on! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:48.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I give up. I can't buy \Nany medicine like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.65,0:14:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go buy your medicine for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An equivalent exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.80,0:14:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to apologize for us lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of us have it hard when our older brothers act rash, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have your reasons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:20.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For us to participate in Mugear-san's research,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we needed to use \Nnames such as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be a child {\i1}and{\i0} \Na State Alchemist—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Elric brothers are \Nthe only ones around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need the Philosopher's Stone that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something my dad spent his whole life researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:41.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, your father was an alchemist as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, one day, \Nhe was suddenly gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why my brother is forcing himself to carry on after our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the complete \Nopposite of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother hates our dad, \Nwho was also an alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our dad was completely absorbed in alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and our mom suffered because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:12.07,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,We've also seen a bunch of other people who have met with sadness because of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, if your brother is doing something wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're the only one \Nwho can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't make others do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do, I think your brother will be deeply hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been a little concerned about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but aren't there a lot of people coughing around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this cough medicine, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:49.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.18,0:17:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.39,0:17:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The impostor is here! \NThe older one! Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That bastard! What a hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.61,0:17:20.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's been fixing the townspeople's hoes and transmuting wheels for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's better than having him do bad things, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:24.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like the way he operates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's ignoring the Law of Equivalent Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, we're going to \Nsneak in there again tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though it's the very next day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because{\i0} it's the very next day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something \NI want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going with \Nthe mole-man strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mole-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:23.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, we should be just about under the building now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we're going to \Ncome out somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be the water that forms the base of the red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The red stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I read some documents about it \Nat the library in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a stone, made of a compound of roughly the same material
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as the Philosopher's Stone, \Nwhich you get by refining red water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:56.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, you can make a Philosopher's Stone from this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it won't be the \Nexact same thing, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:04.03,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,As I remember, some alchemist named Nash-something-or-other was researching it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in the end, it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I suddenly feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:14.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:16.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What are you crying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.11,0:19:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you know something, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really don't like \Nwhat's going on here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That red water...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:56.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's water that's very \Ndangerous to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's vital for creating a red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, the people in town are also coughing because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.55,0:20:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just smash all of this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've finally raised up \Na red stone this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad sacrificed himself for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If his experiments go unfulfilled, he'll never be redeemed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so great about that half-baked rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sword is just a fake too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to mess you up, together with your rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine is the genuine article!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.04,0:21:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the red water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're showered with it, \Nyou're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't just lose consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:14.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your brother is right! \NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose to someone who's chasing after his own pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, Dad was \Nresearching the red water
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:22:00.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to bring happiness to people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet what we're doing is making \Nthe people in town suffer, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.59,0:22:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you should've known this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who \Ngets credit, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:13.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad would not be happy about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 12: "Land of Stones, Part 2"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.56,0:23:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you've taken on the name of Edward Elric,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are you prepared for \Nthe consequences?!
